  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">anti-corr training,Serbia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">antikorr utb, Serbien</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objective is to raise the awareness in the relevant professions and government departments of the newest methodologies to fight corruption in Serbia-Montenegro. To advance the concrete skills and knowledge of the professionals who are naturally in the positions to engage constructively in fighting corruption. The objective also include the publication of the magazine &quot;The Pulse&quot;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utbildning inom anti-korruption f&#xf6;r personer vid central f&#xf6;rvaltning och ber&#xf6;rda myndigheter i Serbien-Montenegro. Insats avser &#xe4;ven publikation av magasinet The Pulse. Genomf&#xf6;rande part &#xe4;r den serbiska organisationen Management Center som har etablerat sig som en respekterad akt&#xf6;r i Serbien-Montenegro avseende forskning och utbildning inom bl a anti-korruption.</narrative>
  </description>
